*** Add File:ops/quantum/backoff_fallback.md
+Backoff and fallback strategy for QPU submissions
+
+1. Queue jobs in shared QPU queue service (qpu_queue_service).
+2. If provider submission fails immediately, mark job with transient error and attempt fallback:
+   - First fallback: run on local/high-fidelity simulator (if acceptable)
+   - Second: re-enqueue with exponential backoff (backoff factor, jitter)
+3. For expensive runs, require approval before re-submitting to avoid billing surprises
+
+Implementation notes:
+ - qpu_queue_service implements simulator fallback for submission errors
+ - Provider adapters should raise specific exceptions for transient vs permanent errors
+ - Scheduler should support requeue_count to limit retries
+
